<title>LATVIA: TALSI FORESTRY TO JOIN SECONDARY BOURSE LIST.</title>
<headline>TALSI FORESTRY TO JOIN SECONDARY BOURSE LIST.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange on Thursday said that Talsi Forestry and would move to the secondary list of the bourse from July 7.</p>
<p>Until now the share has been quoted on the free list of the market, the bourse added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
